# Sweep notes:
# Pattern: execute_upsert_visibility_state|expires_at in ops.rs
# U2: ops.rs line 220 — execute_upsert_visibility_state defined; stores state_json blob (no columnar expires_at).
#     No expires_at field in U2 schema (old visibility state JSON blob). No validation issue on U2.
# U3: Same as U2 — no columnar expires_at; not applicable.
# U4: ops.rs line 232 — execute_upsert_visibility_state now passes expires_at as individual column param.
#     Line 256: request.state.expires_at.map(|value| value.into_inner().to_rfc3339()) — no bounds validation.
#     Finding is open only on U4 (U4 introduced the columnar expires_at field).

